{"id":38,"titleZh":"查尔斯·艾夫斯：美国先驱","titleEn":"Charles Ives: American Pioneer","date":"1967-02-23","dateZh":"1967 年 2 月 23 日","concepts":"音乐实验、拼贴记忆、多节奏与双调性","thesis":"1900 年代欧洲刚习惯德彪西时，这位白天卖保险的美国人已在业余时间靠“敢拿音乐做实验”写出了领先半个世纪的作品。","plain":"伯恩斯坦认为艺术里的冒险精神源自爱探索、不怕古怪的玩心。艾夫斯一生在保险界很成功，晚间则专写当时无人能演奏的曲子：他把小镇童年听见的救火车铃、老民歌和街头军乐撞在一起，故意让两套不同的速度与调性同时行进。","scenes":["介绍艾夫斯引用老歌的作品时，特意现场展示并吹奏少见的“颌琴（口弦）”，演到《林肯》的“地震摇晃”一句时，伯恩斯坦在钢琴上干脆用拳头直接砸向琴键。","压轴罕见地以极安静慢板的《未回答的问题》收尾：弦乐保持稳固慢和弦，小号连续七次吹出提问短句，木管越答越慌乱却始终给不出结论。"],"category":"大师与杰作","bilibili":{"bvid":"BV1eo4y1f7vr","url":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1eo4y1f7vr","title":"掘火中译：伯恩斯坦《年轻人的音乐会》 | 查尔斯·艾夫斯：美国先锋","duration":"54:05","uploader":"掘火档案（掘火中译）"},"scriptUrl":"https://leonardbernstein.com/lectures/television-scripts/young-peoples-concerts/charles-ives-american-pioneer","repertoire":[{"composer":"Charles Ives","piece":"The Gong on the Hook and Ladder (Firemen's Parade on Main Street)","titleZh":"钩梯上的铜锣","previewUrl":null,"appleMusicUrl":null,"recordingArtist":null,"recordingTrack":null,"youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Charles%20Ives%20The%20Gong%20on%20the%20Hook%20and%20Ladder+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Charles%20Ives%20The%20Gong%20on%20the%20Hook%20and%20Ladder"},{"composer":"Charles Ives","piece":"Washington's Birthday from Holidays Symphony","titleZh":"华盛顿诞辰","previewUrl":"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/Music/v4/eb/00/ae/eb00ae6b-1d4a-c9f3-03e6-8da3ec236dd1/mzaf_8934828119191541947.plus.aac.p.m4a","appleMusicUrl":"https://music.apple.com/us/album/washingtons-birthday/893311534?i=893311539&uo=4","recordingArtist":"Imperial Philharmonic of Tokyo & William Strickland","recordingTrack":"Washington's Birthday","youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Charles%20Ives%20Washington%27s%20Birthday%20from%20Holidays%20Symphony+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Charles%20Ives%20Washington%27s%20Birthday